{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2025-08-09T15:14:59Z","updated_at":"2025-08-12T23:44:52Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in the Android and XR editor: 4.4.1-stable, 4.5.0-beta5, `master` branch\n- Not reproducible on desktop versions of the editor\n\n### System information\n\n- Pixel Pro 9 Fold running Android 16, Pixel 8a (emulator) running Android 15, Quest 3 running HorizonOS\n\n### Issue description\n\nAn OpenXR enabled project crashes with a stack overflow error when one of the editor theme properties is updated.\n\nThe stack overflow crash originates from: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/a3b42d85d27668f8992c0779ed3cc82d13db3dd9/core/object/object.cpp#L1237-L1246\n\n- When updating the editor theme settings, a signal is emitted to all registered components. \n- With OpenXR enabled in the project, the OpenXR Action map editor and its components are included in the list of registered components, causing the size of the registered components to grow to several thousands\n- The logic shown above allocates memory on the stack for all registered components.\n- On Android, this runs into the stack limit causing a stack overflow and crashing the editor\n  - From my testing, this is not reproducible on MacOs, which I assume is because of the higher stack limit\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Launch the Android editor\n- Use an existing project or create a new project\n- Enable OpenXR in the project settings under `XR` -> `OpenXR` -> `Enabled`, and restart the editor as suggested\n- Open the editor settings, and navigate to `Interface` -> `Theme`\n-  Update one of the theme properties like `Base Color` and confirm\n- The editor will crash shortly\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e242227e-36ce-4008-b0d0-b6a95577f697\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n- Any project in the Android / XR editor with OpenXR enabled in the project settings.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109464/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109464/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}